### 🧪 TESTS SIMPLES BREVO SMTP - Cleaner App

### 1. Test simple - Vérifier la configuration (sans auth)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/debug/mail-config

### 2. Test simple - Envoyer email test (sans auth)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/debug/test-email-brevo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "loona7757@gmail.com",
  "subject": "🧪 Test Brevo Simple",
  "message": "Test simple de configuration Brevo SMTP"
}

### 3. Test avec curl (alternative)
### Copiez-collez cette commande dans votre terminal:
### curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/debug/test-email-brevo \
###   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
###   -d '{"to": "loona7757@gmail.com", "subject": "Test Brevo", "message": "Test email"}'
